***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Variable overrides — copy to terraform.tfvars and customize
***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
***REMOVED*** Not committed. Set your actual values here.
***REMOVED*** Sensitive values can also be set via TF_VAR_* env vars.
***REMOVED*** ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

***REMOVED*** Optional: override OVH subsidiary (default: "FR")
***REMOVED*** ovh_subsidiary = "FR"

***REMOVED*** VPS display name in OVH Manager
***REMOVED*** vps_display_name = "rodrigo-agent"

***REMOVED*** OVH datacenter (REDACTED-REGION1, REDACTED-REGION1, REDACTED-REGION1, REDACTED-REGION1, etc.)
***REMOVED*** vps_datacenter = "REDACTED-REGION1"

***REMOVED*** VPS plan code (see: https://www.ovhcloud.com/en/vps/)
***REMOVED*** vps_plan_code = "REDACTED-PLAN"   ***REMOVED*** 2 vCPU, 2GB RAM, 40GB NVMe, ~€4/mo
***REMOVED*** vps_plan_code = "vps-value-2-4"   ***REMOVED*** 2 vCPU, 4GB RAM, 80GB NVMe, ~€6/mo

***REMOVED*** OS for the VPS (will be converted to NixOS via nixos-infect)
***REMOVED*** vps_os = "Debian 12"

***REMOVED*** SSH public key (full key string) — requires vps_image_id too
***REMOVED*** Get image IDs: GET /vps/{serviceName}/images/available
***REMOVED*** ssh_public_key = "ssh-ed25519 AAAA..."
***REMOVED*** vps_image_id   = "45b2f222-ab10-44ed-863f-720942762b6f"

***REMOVED*** DNS — domain must be in OVH DNS zone
***REMOVED*** domain_name = "REDACTED-DOMAIN"
***REMOVED*** subdomain   = "agent"
***REMOVED*** dns_ttl     = 300

***REMOVED*** Object Storage bucket names
***REMOVED*** state_bucket_name  = "rodrigo-agent-tofu-state"
***REMOVED*** backup_bucket_name = "rodrigo-agent-backups"
***REMOVED*** storage_region     = "gra"
